  "details": "At some point in the last few months the pinch move using the meta 3s has completely stopped working with VRChat. The finger still registers visually, wiggles, so forth. The contact UI point is just not displayed on the finger on either hand. I have Factory Reset my meta device, reset and reinstalled both steam vr and vrchat. I have gone through several other trouble shooting procedures, clearing caches, different avatars, Changing controller layouts, manually assigning so forth. VRChat is the only game it does not work on.",
